---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ORG } from '../data/org';
---

<Base title="About" description="What mukto.net is, where the name comes from, and the principles it runs on.">
  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>About mukto.net</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A not-for-profit association that runs a shared Linux server, teaches, and holds meetups, for
      anyone in Bangladesh who builds with free software.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap page-body cols">
    <div>
      <h2>The name</h2>
      <p>
        <span lang="bn" class="bn-word">মুক্ত</span> (<em>mukto</em>) means free, open, set loose.
        Bangla calls free software <span lang="bn">মুক্ত সফটওয়্যার</span>, and that's where we took it
        from.
      </p>

      <h2>How it started</h2>
      <p>
        The first plan was small: one shared Unix machine, a tilde server, where everyone gets a
        shell, a home directory and a web page, and learns by poking at what the neighbours built.
      </p>
      <p>
        Thirty-eight people came to the founding adda on 13 June 2026 and wanted more than that:
        classes, install-fests, translation sprints, a place for local open-source projects. So
        mukto.net became something closer to what Framasoft is in France, with the shared server
        still in the middle of it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we hold to</h2>
      <dl class="principles">
        <dt>Free software only</dt>
        <dd>Everything we run is free and open source, configuration included.</dd>
        <dt>No ads or tracking</dt>
        <dd>The status bar at the bottom of every page counts cookies and requests to other sites. Both should read 0.</dd>
        <dt>Built for here</dt>
        <dd>Bangla and English, events outside Dhaka, prices in taka, and ideally a server inside the country.</dd>
        <dt>Rules written down</dt>
        <dd>A code of conduct, a constitution and published accounts, applied by people you can name.</dd>
        <dt>Only what we can keep running</dt>
        <dd>Four services run today. More come when there are volunteers to look after them.</dd>
        <dt>Working with other groups</dt>
        <dd>Several Linux and FOSS groups were here before us. If one of them needs a server for a workshop, they can ask.</dd>
      </dl>

      <h2>What we aren't</h2>
      <p>
        A company, a hosting provider, or production infrastructure for your startup. Nothing here is
        for sale.
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="facts">
      <dl>
        <dt>Legal status</dt>
        <dd>{ORG.status}</dd>
        <dt>Founded</dt>
        <dd>13 June 2026, Dhaka</dd>
        <dt>Server</dt>
        <dd>{ORG.hosting}, since 20 July 2026</dd>
        <dt>Run by</dt>
        <dd><a href="/team/">An elected committee and five working groups</a></dd>
        <dt>Rules</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href="/governance/">Constitution</a>, <a href="/conduct/">code of conduct</a>,
          <a href="/acceptable-use/">acceptable use</a>
        </dd>
        <dt>Money</dt>
        <dd><a href="/accounts/">Quarterly accounts</a></dd>
        <dt>Contact</dt>
        <dd><a href={`mailto:${ORG.email.hello}`}>{ORG.email.hello}</a></dd>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap lineage">
    <h2>Who we learned from</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://sdf.org">SDF</a>, the public Unix system running since 1987</li>
      <li><a href="https://tilde.club">tilde.club</a> and <a href="https://tilde.town">tilde.town</a>, which made shared Unix boxes fun again</li>
      <li><a href="https://hashbang.sh">hashbang.sh</a>, for signing up from the terminal</li>
      <li><a href="https://envs.net">envs.net</a>, a pubnix that grew a whole set of services</li>
      <li><a href="https://framasoft.org">Framasoft</a>, for free services and teaching as a public good</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 20rem;
    gap: 2rem 4rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .cols h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .cols h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }
  .bn-word {
    font-size: 1.3em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .principles {
    max-width: var(--measure);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .principles dt {
    font-weight: 650;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .principles dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .facts {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--flag);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .facts dl {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .facts dt {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .lineage {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }
  .lineage h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }
  .lineage ul {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
